<title>GERMANY: Munich airport passenger traffic up 6pct in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>Munich airport passenger traffic up 6pct in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger traffic at Munich</p>
<p>airport rose six percent year-on-year to more than 1.1 million</p>
<p>travellers in February, Flughafen Muenchen GmbH said.</p>
<p>The following tables show 1997 passenger details with</p>
<p>percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p> Feb 1997	    Monthly total	Pct change</p>
<p> Total		 1,172,233	    Up  6.0</p>
<p> Foreign		 652,107	    Up  8.4</p>
<p> Domestic		501,753	    Up  2.8</p>
<p> Transit		  18,373	    Up 15.1</p>
<p> Jan-Feb 1997	Cumulative total   Pct change</p>
<p> Total		 2,314,410	    Up  8.5</p>
<p> Foreign	     1,297,129	    Up 11.1</p>
<p> Domestic		981,052	    Up  5.0</p>
<p> Transit		  36,229	    Up 16.3</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH, traffic statistics dept. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
</text>
